            <span class="tile-ico blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v14c0 1.66 3.58 3 8 3s8-1.34 8-3V5"/><path d="M4 12c0 1.66 3.58 3 8 3s8-1.34 8-3"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Schema, never rows</h3>
            <p>Turn on schema access and agents read your real structure through <code>get_schema</code> to write accurate SQL. Never exposes any row data.</p>
